= Definition

#definition(title: [Vector Bundle])[
    Let $X$ be a scheme. A _vector bundle_ on $X$ is a finite locally free $cal(O)_X$-module $cal(E)$. It has rank $r$ if, on an open cover of $X$,
    $ cal(E)|_U ≅ cal(O)_U^(plus.o r). $
] <definition>
